os/godotengine/godot/issues/107706","id":2988036713,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yGdJp","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-19T13:02:51Z","updated_at":"2025-06-19T13:02:51Z","body":">  Is there any use for oversampling in font\n\nFor the most part, these assets are designed accounting for a certain \"filter\" applied to them at all times, so by all means, yes. Similar sentiment to https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/5225#issuecomment-1222281155\n\n> textures like all assets ate authored with a certain final look in mind, and that should be reflected as a property of the resource itself, and not left as a responsibility for the user of the resource (in this case the node).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2988036713/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]